      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY BEAUTIFUL LIFE (2) was yet again about the mark last time out when runner-up over 2200m at Launceston, beaten 5.5 metres. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. It doesn't get any easier but she is capable of adding to the fine recent form. LA PIERRE (4) followed a fourth first-up two runs back with a distant last when he broke in a 2180m event at Burnie two-and-a-half weeks ago. Needs to get it right to beat this field but he is up to the job. SOLO SAFARI (3) is better than his last-start run when finishing 11th over 1609m at this track. Worth another chance. KUHIO CREST (6) disappointed last time when 12th over 1609m at this track. Can turn things around.",
